畔佩戴小巧蝴蝶结耳饰，颈间垂落心形吊坠项链，细节精致而不张扬。\n\n前景为木质家具的局部，纹理清晰，与人物形成温润的视觉依托。中景聚焦于人物全身造型，波点图案在柔和光线下呈现出微妙的立体感，衣料质感细腻，袖口与裙摆的蕾丝边缘更显柔美。背景为浅米色墙面，简洁干净，无多余装饰，使人物主体更加突出。\n\n构图采用中景偏上视角，人物居画面中央，身体微侧，手轻搭木柜，姿态自然放松，营造出静谧而优雅的氛围。视觉引导由人物面部逐步延伸至服装细节，再过渡至背景，形成柔和的视觉流线。色调以米白、奶油色与深黑波点为主，搭配暖木色背景，整体呈现出复古奶油系的柔光氛围。\n\n光影柔和，来自左上方的自然光在人物面部与肩部形成微妙明暗过渡，皮肤质感细腻自然，无过度渲染。整体氛围静谧、温柔、略带文艺气息，如同午后阳光洒落的旧式客厅。\n\nmake the subjects skin details more prominent and natural", "1,2,3", 1, 1536, 384, "lanczos", "center", "Describe the key features of the input image (color, shape, size, texture, objects, background), then explain how the user's text instruction should alter or modify the image. Generate a new image that meets the user's requirements while maintaining consistency with the original input where appropriate."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 1601, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 1602, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "vl_resize_indexs"}, "shape": 7, "name": "vl_resize_indexs", "label": "vl_resize_indexs", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "vl_resize_indexs"}, {"widget": {"name": "main_image_index"}, "shape": 7, "name": "main_image_index", "label": "main_image_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "main_image_index"}, {"widget": {"name": "target_size"}, "shape": 7, "name": "target_size", "label": "target_size", "t